{"sections":{"section_E3hgPz":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_cRnAUQ":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<h2>Our Products<\/h2>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_UBHNmj":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><\/p><p>Neu+ is a next-generation NAD+ shot designed to support your body at the cellular level. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neu-plus.com\/pages\/the-science\">Built around the science of healthy ageing<\/a>, Neu+ helps fuel energy, focus, and resilience from the inside out.<\/p><p>Unlike traditional supplements that rely on minimal “label doses” and poor absorption, Neu+ delivers a carefully formulated blend of science-backed ingredients in a fast absorbing liquid format. Every shot is designed to work with your biology, not against it.<\/p><p>This is proactive wellness. No pills. No complex routines. Just one great-tasting daily shot, designed to support how you feel today and how you age tomorrow.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"paragraph","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_cRnAUQ","text_UBHNmj"],"name":"t:names.custom_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"fl